  "description": "Details required by condition nos. 3a, 3e, 3g, 3h and 3i (Submission of details - a) sample and details of the external paint colour, the paint to be mineral based paint; e) detailed internal elevation drawings (1:10) and sections (1:5), of the proposed kitchen joinery and works to the fireplace opening to the ground-floor kitchen. New joinery to be scribed around existing joinery and to be set below the retained historic cornice;g) details of new stone / mosaic floor finish to hall, showing retention of historic joists and, if extant, floorboards; h) details of new joinery and fireplace to first-floor front room, in elevation (1:10) and section (1:5). Joinery to be in timber; and i) details of floor strengthening, including plan of the location of new and additional joists, and methodology of works; ) of listed building consent 23/07819 (Internal refurbishment and reconfiguration throughout. Installation of comfort cooling, with condenser unit located at rear of garden. Removal of trees to front lightwell. Alterations to rear garden, including new hard landscaping, lawn and extended sunken garden connected to lower ground floor. Converting a window to an external door to form access to garden. Replacement of all windows, with slimline double glazed windows. External redecoration of fa‡ade and balconies/metalwork. External alterations to non-original rear extension, including replacing rooflight, and new windows and doors. Installation of six PV panels to roof.)",
